    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d735">

                <pb facs="d734-2" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d734-2"/>

                <head>735. Telegram 416 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d735-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-10-18">October 18, 1956, 6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d735-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d735-1"/>
                <p>416. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Comments today’s meeting:</p>
                <p>Wang clearly plotted their future course at today’s meeting and barring
                    unforeseen reversal only question is timing. Believe most likely course is
                    release shortly after next meeting of public statement along lines his today’s
                    prepared statement. In this event or in event break next meeting propose
                    immediately issue here public statement accordance draft being transmitted by
                    letter.</p>
                <p>Propose at next meeting make careful review our position noting implied threat
                    last sentence his today’s prepared statement and also again making mention
                    missing POW issue. While will not go into details latter issue this meeting will
                    appreciate most recent statistical summary that situation. Suggest release our
                    implementation statement before next meeting.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
